---
layout: sidebar.njk
heading: Training
sidebarKey: training
heroImage: /images/header-bg.jpg
---

<div class="container">
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="title is-2" id="trainingszeiten">Trainingszeiten</h2>
    <p>Wir trainieren derzeit im {{ training.trainingsstätte }}.</p>

    <div class="grid is-col-min-10">
      {% for gruppe in training.zeiten %}
        <article class="message is-primary">
          <div class="message-header">
            <p>{{ gruppe.name }}</p>
          </div>
          <div class="message-body">
            <ul>
              {% for termin in gruppe.termine %}
                <li><strong>{{ termin.tag }}:</strong> {{ termin.zeit }}</li>
                <li>mit {{ termin.trainer | join(', ') }}</li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="title is-2" id="probetraining">Probetraining</h2>
    <p>
      Du kannst gerne bei uns zum Probetraining reinschnuppern. Da jedoch vor
      allem die Gruppen mit den Schwimmanfängern sehr voll sind, haben wir eine
      Warteliste. Trage dich bzw. dein Kind gerne in unser Formular ein. Sobald
      wir Kapazitäten dafür haben, melden wir uns bei dir.
      <br />
      <a
        class="button is-link"
        href="https://forms.gle/x2g5LVhuHqwe8tzE6"
        target="_blank"
      >
        <span class="icon">
          <i class="fas fa-clipboard-list"></i>
        </span>
        <span> Formular zur Warteliste fürs Probetraining </span>
      </a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="title is-2" id="trainer">Unsere Trainer</h2>
    <div class="grid is-col-min-12">
      {% for person in training.trainer %}
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-image">
            <figure class="image">
              <img
                src="{{ person.bild | default('/images/personen/placeholder.png') }}"
                alt="{{ person.name }}"
                class="portrait"
              />
              <!--
            <img
              src="{{ person.bildAction | default('/images/personen/placeholder-action.png') }}"
              alt="{{ person.name }} in Action"
              class="action"
            />
          -->
            </figure>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <div class="media-content">
              <p class="title is-4">{{ person.name }}</p>
              <p class="subtitle is-6">{{ person.gruppen | join(', ') }}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="content">
              <em>"{{ person.ausbildung }}"</em>
              <br />
              Am Beckenrand seit {{ person.seitWann }}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="title is-2" id="faq">FAQ</h2>
    {% for item in faq %}
      {% if "training" in item.tags %}
        <details class="box faq-item mb-4">
          <summary
            class="is-size-5 has-text-weight-semibold is-flex is-justify-content-space-between is-align-items-center is-flex-wrap-wrap"
          >
            <span>{{ item.frage }}</span>
            {% if item.tags %}
              <div class="tags">
                {% for tag in item.tags %}
                  <span class="tag is-primary is-light is-small"
                    >{{ tag }}</span
                  >
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </summary>
          <div class="content mt-4 pt-4" style="border-top: 1px solid #eee;">
            {{ item.antwort | safe }}
            {% if item.images %}
              <div class="columns is-multiline is-mobile news-gallery">
                {% for image in item.images %}
                  <div class="column is-3-desktop is-4-tablet is-6-mobile">
                    <a
                      href="{{ image.src }}"
                      data-caption="{{ image.description }}"
                    >
                      <figure class="image is-1by1">
                        <img
                          src="{{ image.src }}"
                          alt="{{ image.description }}"
                          style="object-fit: cover; border-radius: 6px; width: 100%; height: 100%;"
                        />
                      </figure>
                    </a>
                  </div>
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </details>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
</div>
